STATUS  CHECK         DETAIL
ok      claude        claude not on PATH; not used: the orchestrator runs codex and workers run codex
warn    agent CLIs    harness claude can't run (claude not on PATH); codex can, so saddle up runs codex; usable: codex (no hooks); Codex has no hooks, so claims are checked only at commit and done, not on each edit
ok      orchestrator  runs on codex (model codex's default), since claude can't run; codex-cli 1.0.0 (fake); no approvals or sandbox (it runs saddle, gh and read-only git); saddle's MCP tools are passed to every turn; no hooks, so [saddle] events reach it between turns, not mid-turn

Optional:
  - agent CLIs (the agent CLIs (claude, codex, grok) installed and logged in, and which one saddle up runs)
      harness claude can't run (claude not on PATH); codex can, so saddle up runs codex; usable: codex (no hooks); Codex has no hooks, so claims are checked only at commit and done, not on each edit
